# 8051 Microcontroller Projects

## About This Repository
This repository contains a collection of projects based on the 8051 Microcontroller, developed using Assembly Language and Embedded C.

It covers practical implementations of microcontroller concepts, hardware interfacing, programming techniques, and embedded system applications.

## Technologies & Tools
- 8051 Microcontroller
- Embedded C
- 8051 Assembly Language
- Keil µVision IDE
- Proteus Design Suite

## Topics Covered
- Digital Input/Output Interfacing
- LED and Switch Interfacing
- Timer and Counter Programming
- Interrupt Handling
- LCD Interfacing
- Seven Segment Display
- Serial Communication (UART)
- Sensor Interfacing
- Embedded Systems Applications

## Objective
To develop practical knowledge of 8051 microcontroller programming, understand embedded system fundamentals, and build hands-on hardware interfacing projects.

More projects and experiments will be added as I continue learning and exploring embedded systems.
